userStories.description:
**Goal** — Complete the web migration with temporary legacy URL redirects and removal of unused fleet inbox code.

**Motivation** — 7c deletes the fleet adapters once nothing in the web calls them.

**Approach** — **Redirects keep the query and use 302.** `/admin/fleet/approvals` and `/[project]/fleet/approvals` become redirect pages, the `pages/projects.vue` pattern, keeping `?id=`. A temporary redirect is used because the fleet notifications still link to `/admin/fleet/approvals` until 7c, and a cached 301 would outlive that.

Turns `pages/admin/fleet/approvals.vue` and `pages/[project]/fleet/approvals.vue` into 302 redirects that keep `?id`.

Deletes:
- `components/fleet/ApprovalInbox.vue`, `ApprovalBashPanel.vue`, `ApprovalBudgetPanel.vue`, `ApprovalActionPanel.vue` and `ApprovalOutcome.vue`;
- `composables/useFleetApprovals.ts`, `composables/useApprovalNotifications.ts` and `composables/useActionPreview.ts`;
- the fleet-only exports of `lib/fleet-approvals.ts`;
- the admin nav link to `/admin/fleet/approvals`.

Deletes the test files of the deleted code: tests/pages/fleet-approvals-pages.spec.ts, tests/components/fleet-approval-{inbox,action-panel,bash-panel,budget-panel,outcome}.spec.ts, tests/composables/useFleetApprovals.spec.ts and tests/composables/useActionPreview.spec.ts.

Rewrites the two fleet approval E2E journeys onto `/[project]/approvals`.

Verification: `bun run type-check`, `bun run lint` and `bun run test` in `apps/web`. A removed export that is still imported fails the type check.

The `lib/fleet-approvals.ts` exports to delete:
- `INBOX_PENDING_SIZE`, `INBOX_PAGE_SIZE`;
- `ApprovalBase`, `ApprovalViewer`, `INBOX_TABS`, `InboxTab`, `ApprovalListFilters`;
- `buildApprovalQuery`, `sortPending`;
- `AssistantApprovalPayload`, `assistantPayload`;
- `canDecide`, `toRaiseBody`, `toKeepPausedBody`, `toBashBody`, `toActionBody`;
- `threadApiPath`, `keyboardDecision`, `firstPending`;
- `requeueResults`, `resumedAmount`, `pendingByPolicy`;
- `inboxPath`, `badgeTarget`, `approvalSummary`;
- `MAX_COMMENT`, `commentTooLong`, `buildRaiseSchema` (only the deleted panels use them);
- the imports these deletions leave unused.

Retain bashPayload, bashChoices, commandPreview, budgetPayload, raiseAmountError, secondsLeft, countdownText, deliveryView, requeueFailure, badgeText, BADGE_CAP and their necessary supporting types/constants. Keep FleetApprovalDto because retained helpers still name it. Keep fleet_approval/onFleetApproval, fleet API routes/keys/notifications and CLI; 7c retires those. ThreadActionCard.vue and useApprovalRequests.ts remain unchanged.

Remove canReadFleetApprovals from layout showAdminNav and fleet.approval.read/canReadFleetApprovals from the permission-nav helper. Update default-permission-nav to assert old admin link absence for fleet.approval.read. Drop deleted-helper cases from tests/lib/fleet-approvals.spec.ts while preserving kept-helper cases. In mount-sfc remove the five deleted component map/union entries and useActionPreview from NUXT_AUTO_IMPORTS. Remove remaining canDecide/ApprovalViewer US-009 AC-2/AC-7 and two-pages AC-6 approval blocks from fleet-schedule-approval-gates.spec.ts; keep schedule cases. Remove obsolete useFleetApprovals doubles and not-called assertions from thread-action-card.spec.ts without changing the card.

Rewrite tests/e2e/fleet-approvals.e2e.spec.ts and fleet-bash-approvals.e2e.spec.ts for project engine inbox and new decision panels. Change tests/e2e/fixtures/fleet-approvals-api.ts to engine lists, projectId/permissionKey/jobId filters and detail fetching where policyId/jobId used to come from summaries. Add tests/pages/fleet-approvals-redirects.spec.ts. Redirects preserve the full query including id and explicitly use 302 rather than the reference page's 301. Run the specified web quality gates plus relevant Playwright journeys using waitForHydration, not networkidle. This story changes runtime compatibility/removal behavior and is not a test-only story.

**Scope** — In: redirect pages, precise obsolete web implementation/export/spec deletion, test-helper/nav updates and E2E migration. Out: engine functionality from preceding stories, API adapter/event/DTO/notification retirement (7c), FleetApprovalDto deletion, thread-card changes and new breadcrumbs.

**Interface** — `/admin/fleet/approvals` redirects to `/approvals`; `/[project]/fleet/approvals` redirects to `/<slug>/approvals`; preserve route.query and use `navigateTo(..., { redirectCode: 302 })` with the pages/projects.vue redirect-page structure.
